\item OpenAI, \emph{Mass and covering exponents for fixed-length honeycomb walks}, 2026-09-26; citation key \texttt{OAI:Mass-and-covering-exponents-for-fixed-length-honeycomb-walks-September-26-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Mass-and-covering-exponents-for-fixed-length-honeycomb-walks-September-26-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Mass-and-covering-exponents-for-fixed-length-honeycomb-walks-September-26-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Mass-and-covering-exponents-for-fixed-length-honeycomb-walks-September-26-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Mass-and-covering-exponents-for-fixed-length-honeycomb-walks-September-26-2026/main.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Mass-and-covering-exponents-for-fixed-length-honeycomb-walks-September-26-2026/build/sections/00\_introduction.tex\#L17}{thm:main}.
\item Family 237: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/237.md}{Lean scope}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/CONTENTS.md}{OpenAI catalogue entry}.
